Lent Isn’t About Giving Up — It’s About Making Space for God

📌 YouTube Description
Lent is more than sacrifice.
It’s an invitation to clear the noise, slow down, and make room for God to move in your life.

In this short reflection, we explore the deeper meaning of Lent — not as a season of deprivation, but as a season of opening.
Opening your heart.
Opening your habits.
Opening your time.
Opening space for grace.

If you’ve ever wondered what Lent is really about, or how to enter it with purpose and peace, this episode is for you.

